# index.ts

- Export parts (`Component` or `Component.Root` / `.Trigger` / …) from `index.ts`.
- **No TypeScript `namespace`** (`@typescript-eslint/no-namespace`; types are not runtime object fields).
- **Prop types (library convention):**
  - Prefer consumer path: `ComponentProps<typeof Button>` / `ComponentProps<typeof Disclosure.Root>` (React + `@types/react`).
  - Also export named interfaces for authors/extends: `ButtonProps`, `DisclosureRootProps`, …
- Context: named `useXContext` + `XContextValue` type export.
- Component-owned state hooks: named exports; never a `Hooks` bag pretending to hold types.
- Cross-component lifecycle (e.g. `usePresence`) lives in `src/package/ui/utils`.
- One export: inline. Multiple: `EXPORTS` section.
- Do not re-export internals (raw a11y specs) unless part of public API.
